+DRM DRIVER FOR ILITEK ILI9488 PANELS
+M:	Igor Reznichenko <igor@reznichenko.net>
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,ili9488.yaml
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-ili9488.c
